  "historicalArtifactsUntouched": true,
  "resolutions": [
    "The first real size run failed because unscoped pass options also applied to AAC. Video-scoped pass/passlog options fix it; final full matrix is green.",
    "Strict Clippy found needless borrows and a range idiom in the initial context refactor; fixed without lint allowances.",
    "Form tests caught duplicate custom-cap labels, unsupported Testing Library exact options and a text-encoding regression. The final UTF-8 source and 496 tests pass.",
    "Default axe caught the missing main landmark and low-contrast tertiary captions; the main region and accessible secondary text preserve layout.",
    "Asset auditing now resolves reused component SVG paths. Two repeated captures differed at 25 right/bottom rounded-border pixels with identical DOM. Capturing inside the existing viewport avoids CDP resizing; the final renderer uses default Chromium with no software-GPU override or product-state freeze.",
    "Reference typography, 32px primary action, original label/meta chips and the Settings Files caption are reflected in the final captures. Earlier captures remain unmodified.",
    "Native review sizing includes scrollable content and observes DOM changes: a loading viewport can grow after inspection; the final native trim asserts all fields fit. Source reload clears the previous estimate and resets Exact mode; a generation guard ignores a late successful GPU mode response for the previous source."
  ]
}
